  "seoBody": "<p>Quickler is priced per report, not per seat. One pound per completed report, with unlimited users and workflows on every bundle. Every account starts with a 14-day free trial and no card is required to begin.</p><h2>Bundles</h2><ul><li><strong>Quickler 50</strong> &mdash; 50 reports per month, &pound;50 per month.</li><li><strong>Quickler 100</strong> &mdash; 100 reports per month, &pound;100 per month.</li><li><strong>Quickler 250</strong> &mdash; 250 reports per month, &pound;250 per month.</li><li><strong>Quickler 500</strong> &mdash; 500 reports per month, &pound;500 per month.</li></ul><p>Need more than 500 reports a month? <a href=\"mailto:hello@quickler.co\">Talk to us</a>. Every bundle includes unlimited users, managers and workflows; you only pay for the reports you finish.</p><h2>Payment</h2><p>We collect by <strong>Direct Debit</strong>. You authorise once; we draw monthly from your bank account. No card numbers stored. You're protected by the Direct Debit Guarantee &mdash; refunds are immediate if anything goes wrong.</p><h2>Upgrading</h2><p>Approaching your monthly report limit and the dashboard prompts you to move up a bundle. You pay the pro-rata difference for the rest of the current cycle; the new price applies from the next one.</p><h2>Downgrading</h2><p>Using fewer reports than your bundle covers? Drop to a smaller bundle and the new price takes effect next cycle.</p><h2>Cancelling</h2><p>Email <a href=\"mailto:hello@quickler.co\">hello@quickler.co</a>. Your subscription ends at the next billing date. Export your data first &mdash; see <a href=\"/pages/help/privacy.html\">Data &amp; privacy</a>.</p><h2>Invoices</h2><p>Every payment generates an invoice emailed to your primary admin. Need a historical one resent? Email support.</p><p>Still stuck? Email <a href=\"mailto:hello@quickler.co\">hello@quickler.co</a> &mdash; we reply within one business day.</p>",
